---
import type { SampleNews } from '../data/sampleNews';
interface Props { story: SampleNews }
const { story } = Astro.props;
---
<article class="story" aria-labelledby={`title-${story.id}`}>
  <div class="story-num" aria-hidden="true">{story.id}</div>
  <div class="story-body">
    <div class="story-cat">{story.category} / SAMPLE</div>
    <h3 id={`title-${story.id}`}>{story.title}</h3>
    <p>{story.excerpt}</p>
    <details class="story-expand">
      <summary>サンプルを読む <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></summary>
      <p class="detail-text">{story.description}</p>
      <small>※ 実際の報道・出典ではありません。記事詳細ページはIssue #3で実装予定です。</small>
    </details>
  </div>
</article>
